<title>JAPAN: Sotetsu Kigyo - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Sotetsu Kigyo - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  6.18		vs	    6.07</p>
<p> Operating	  317    million    vs	  267    million</p>
<p> Current	    369    million    vs	  342    million</p>
<p> Net		  194    million    vs	  189    million</p>
<p> EPS		   26.46 yen	  vs	   26.46 yen</p>
<p> Shares		7 million	  vs	   7 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.25 yen	  vs	    4.25 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Sotetsu Kigyo Co Ltd is involved in building maintenance and security.</p>
